{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（15日）下午1時許，警方接報，青山公路新田段近新田公共運輸交匯處，一輛新界的士與一輛電單車相撞。救援人員到場，將傷者送往北區醫院治理。警方正調查意外成因。</p><p>網上影片可見，鐵騎士受傷倒臥在的士右邊車門對開地上，的士司機上前查看他的情況。</p><figure><img alt=\"鐵騎士倒臥在地，的士司機上前查看他的情況。（網上影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198633491865276416265389.png/gFM52SLMsMEWbY4f5F59c-w8UjYQ-wHIieqIj4nqiI8\"/><figcaption>鐵騎士倒臥在地，的士司機上前查看他的情況。（網上影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鐵騎士受傷倒臥在地。（網上影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198633489256288256026378.png/IZ0um-elEiYNTnEkwjf29hhKVg9Aip8Iz9ueNs_bnjY\"/><figcaption>鐵騎士受傷倒臥在地。（網上影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"青山公路新田段近新田公共運輸交匯處，的士與電單車相撞。（網上影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198633486844432384497120.png/xwh384wakmLE_4uJYWAcOlL_odMKS0qLsyKBPLMigTw\"/><figcaption>青山公路新田段近新田公共運輸交匯處，的士與電單車相撞。（網上影片截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T06:15:52.266964+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":205,"images":3,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T06:07:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T19:50:54.665845+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T06:09:48.779321+00:00","content_hash":"d0d45202f26cf012b7f076568e0e935ae519ae24305207937e9279bc1a6e0a38","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}